      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting paragraph (h);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_12__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsection (4); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_12__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (5), by substituting for the words “subsection (1)” the words “this section”. Amendment of section 136"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 136(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “(aa) by way of electronic means;”. Saving"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any order, directions, circular or notice issued or made by the Commissioner immediately before the commencement of this Act shall be deemed to be issued or made by the Commissioner under the principal Act as amended by this Act and shall remain valid."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any code of practice registered and issued by the Commissioner immediately before the commencement of this Act shall be deemed to be issued or made by the Commissioner under the principal Act as amended by this Act and shall remain valid."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any investigation, trial, proceedings or action pending before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be continued in accordance with the provisions of the principal Act as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Personal Data Protection (Amendment) Act 2024."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act. General amendment"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Personal Data Protection Act 2010 [Act 709], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended by substituting for the words “data user” and “data users” wherever appearing including in the shoulder note the words “data controller” and “data controllers” except in the definition of “register” under section 4, and section 9. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_f"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended in section 4—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “register”, by substituting for the words “Register of Data Users, Register of Data User Forums” the words “Register of Data Controllers, Register of Data Controller Forums”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “register” the following definition: ‘ “biometric data” means any personal data resulting from technical processing relating to the physical, physiological or behavioural characteristics of a person;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “sensitive personal data”, by inserting after the words “alleged commission by him of any offence” the words “, biometric data”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “authorized officer” the following definition: ‘ “personal data breach” means any breach of personal data, loss of personal data, misuse of personal data or unauthorized access of personal data;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “requestor”, by substituting for the words “data access request or data correction request” the words “data access request, data correction request or data portability request”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “data subject”, by inserting after the words “the personal data” the words “and shall not include a deceased individual”. Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 5 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/21/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
